# night20 (2026-07-26): overnight wide-harness run — ALL 14 pool overfit legs
# (recall focus: harness width is a recall lever) + the 6 FP-prone correct
# legs as the precision stress-guard. -n 7 -m 16 with the family-novelty
# steering gate (each harness must add an uncovered check family, 2-reject
# cap fail-open). BURNED legs - mechanism + width evaluation.
